{"id":2136022267,"name":"FNAF: The Original Trilogy Roleplay","desc":"DISCLAIMER: A decent computer is needed to play this game.\r\n\r\nGreetings, and welcome to FNAF: The Original Trilogy RP!\r\nThis roleplay game is a compilation of FNAF1, FNAF2 and FNAF3 packed into one single game.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n-Play as your favorite Five Nights at Freddy's characters ranging from Freddy Fazbear, Bonnie, Chica, Foxy, The Puppet, so many characters!\r\n-Roleplay in your favorite locations from the games\r\n-Badge Characters: There are badges hidden in different areas of the map, find their locations to unlock unique characters!\r\nThis game was made possible thanks to the huge success of our other FNAF RP game, Circus Baby's Pizza World Roleplay.\r\n\r\nCredits (Mostly listed in-game):\r\nIns1dious_Tim - Game Creator\r\nC1a4k_K3nt - Co-Creator\r\ntr_1cky - Helped with the game\r\nScott Cawthon - Creating Five Nights at Freddy's\r\nSteel Wool - Some props from FNAF:HW","path":"/game/2136022267-fnaf-the-original-trilogy-roleplay","slug":"2136022267-fnaf-the-original-trilogy-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/48780e037239d0f368b45452f0104fb8125fb15bf903ac83b6d26aec26f1e41e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2b108817eb62e6189d894fa41fb6dbbe/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":34021174,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-06T10:30:55.525Z","creator":{"name":"Ins1dious_Tim","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"FNAF:-The-Original-Trilogy-Roleplay-Script-RP-47667","_id":"68932edfb504d17ff32c109e","title":"Script RP","game":{"_id":"68932edfb504d17ff32c1099","gameId":2136022267,"name":"FNAF: The Original Trilogy Roleplay","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":2136022267},"features":"COMPUTER VERSION\n\nTelepor